<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>A good place to start with this problem is by figuring out how to merge =
just two sorted linked lists. We can do this by initiating a pointer at the=
 start of both linked lists. Comparing the nodes at these pointers, add the=
 smaller one to the output linked list and advance the corresponding pointe=
r. This results in a combined sorted linked list:</p>
